\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/328-e_31.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a></b></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><div align=\"center\"><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">鄭名芝</span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">疫情</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">林榮淑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/hau-hainn-e-2021lian.html\" target=\"_blank\">Háu hainn ê太魯閣號</a></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/hau-hainn-e-2021lian.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">——抒寫2021年太魯閣號列車敗lián事故</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">林俊義<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">無仝款ê滋味</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">崎仔頭赤子<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/blog-post_10.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿媽有縛粽--無</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">主講／陳逸凡</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記錄／戴如意</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_6.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">老身猶原在</span></a></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_6.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">——《台灣教會公報》ê過去、現在、未來</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">醫學台文</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">林杏佳</span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kap.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">關連kap因果</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台文通訊30歲</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳嘉正&nbsp;<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/30.html\" target=\"_blank\">《台文通訊》30年</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">夏途島<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_23.html\" target=\"_blank\">獨台會案主角記持中ê幾項仔代誌</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>11</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">楊振裕<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kah.html\" target=\"_blank\">肉粽角kah大風車</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>13</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳建中<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/blog-post_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">熱天</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lîm Liû-sîn<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">疫情之下ê新生活</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳文仲<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">早齋</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A-Pó<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/mihbeh.html\" target=\"_blank\">為啥mi̍h我beh學台語？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蕭聿萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">無--去--ê</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>19</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bóng講笑</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">黃靜惠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kap_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">無差——「牛屎kap蛇精」笑詼輯（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">石牧民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/sian.html\" target=\"_blank\">賴和先（sian）寫台文</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">讀冊開講</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">呂美親<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kah-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">自然、典雅、在地化</a></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kah-e.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">——速記kah囡仔「聽」《你無聽--過ê格林童話》</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">26</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張日東<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/loo-tsi.html\" target=\"_blank\">Lòo-tsí</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蔡惠芬<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_16.html\" target=\"_blank\">終身透流恩愛ê序大</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Sann-kap讀小說&nbsp;</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張家榮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/e_4.html\" target=\"_blank\">玄奇ê囡仔仙（十四）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>35</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2020/05/30.html\" target=\"_blank\">台文通訊30歲徵稿啟事</a></span></h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>34</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://www.tgb.org.tw/2021/05/2021a-khioh-siunn.html\" target=\"_blank\">2021 A-Khioh Siúnn (阿却賞) 簡章</a></span></h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br />寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kapeto-tek-kap-sim-leng-e-ke-tat.html\" target=\"_blank\">道德kap心靈ê價值</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/kapeto-tek-kap-sim-leng-e-ke-tat.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tō-tek kap Sim-lêng ê Kè-ta̍t</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">40</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蔡逸民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/koh-ah.html\" target=\"_blank\">熱--人koh到--ah</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>42</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台羅會交流道</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tiuⁿ, Ho̍k Chû<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/tbts-30-tang.html\" target=\"_blank\">TBTS 30 Tang</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/09/tbts-30-tang.html\" target=\"_blank\">《台文通訊》30冬&nbsp;</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">44</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">李江却台語文教基金會捐款徵信</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>2021年7--月<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>46</span></div></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed;\"><tbody>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<span></span></span></p><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: bot